{
  "id": 8834799861959,
  "title": "Folklore Tree of Life in Celtic Knot Quilt",
  "handle": "folklore-tree-of-life-in-celtic-knot-quilt-40ab1f6113-40ab1f6113",
  "body_html": "<p>Elevate your bedroom with our exquisite Jeminise Viking Celtic Tree of Life Quilt. Designed for both functionality and aesthetic appeal, this customizable quilt features a detailed Celtic line art design that brings folklore and warmth into your home. Perfectly matched with optional pillowcases, it makes a thoughtful and unique gift for family, friends, and Viking lovers on birthdays, holidays, or anniversaries.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Personalize this quilt with your own text or name to create a truly unique keepsake.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Celtic Folklore Theme:</strong> Features a beautifully detailed Celtic Tree of Life pattern with intertwined branches and twisted roots.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfortable Material:</strong> Crafted with a breathable soft polyester outer layer and filled with high-quality silk floss for cozy, all-season warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Multiple Sizes Available:</strong> Choose from Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (91x102 inches) to fit your space.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and quick to dry for easy maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Components:</strong> Available as a single quilt or can be customized to include matching pillowcases.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Viking-05</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Tree of Life, Viking</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Viking Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Viking Decor</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash, Dry Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
